          "expr": "sum(rate(docify_http_requests_total{namespace=~\"$namespace\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(docify_http_requests_total{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
